# =============================================================================
# DOCUMENTATION HEADER — LLM Allocator — user prompt template
# =============================================================================
# This header is documentation for maintainers. The runtime loader reads the
# entire file (including these lines) into the LLM prompt string. Keep the
# original instructional sections below unchanged in meaning and order.
#
# SECTION: Placeholders
#   {task_descriptions} and {agent_descriptions} JSON blobs from LLMAllocator.allocate().
#
# SECTION: Instruction
#   Assign each task to a fitting agent.
#
# SECTION: Response shape
#   Historically says task_id→agent_id map; runtime parses Allocation.allocations via response_format.
#
# =============================================================================
Given the following tasks and agents, assign each task to the agent whose capabilities fit it.

Tasks: {task_descriptions}
Agents: {agent_descriptions}

Respond with a JSON object: {{task_id: agent_id, ...}}